ThothTerm for Android
=====================

ThothTerm is a modified derivative work (fork) of the "TermOne Plus" terminal
emulator project (https://gitlab.com/termapps/termoneplus) by Roumen Petrov and
contributors, which is itself based on "Terminal Emulator for Android" by Jack
Palevich and the Android Open Source Project.

Modifications by the ThothTerm project include a rebranded application
identity, package name and user-facing resources. The upstream copyright
notices and license terms are retained in the source file headers.

